rline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/intl\\/de\\/search\\/howsearchworks\\/algorithms\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/www.google.com\\/intl\\/de\\/search\\/howsearchworks\\/algorithms\\/<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/85Nyi4Xb9PY\\\">https:\\/\\/youtu.be\\/85Nyi4Xb9PY<\\/a> (The Invention And History Of Google | Silicon Valley: The Untold Story)<\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=x2WDVG0dvnE\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=x2WDVG0dvnE<\\/a> (Tradition of Innovation: Larry Page and Sergey Brin, Co-founders)<\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.golem.de\\/news\\/hummingbird-neuer-suchalgorithmus-bei-google-1309-101828.html\\\">https:\\/\\/www.golem.de\\/news\\/hummingbird-neuer-suchalgorithmus-bei-google-1309-101828.html<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.trafficdesign.de\\/knowhow\\/seo\\/e-a-t\\\">https:\\/\\/www.trafficdesign.de\\/knowhow\\/seo\\/e-a-t<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/de.semrush.com\\/blog\\/top-der-meistbesuchten-webseiten\\/\\\">https:\\/\\/de.semrush.com\\/blog\\/top-der-meistbesuchten-webseiten\\/<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" class=\\\"text-primary underline\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/about.google\\/intl\\/ALL_de\\/locations\\/?region=europe&amp;office=hamburg\\\">https:\\/\\/about.google\\/intl\\/ALL_de\\/locations\\/?region=europe&amp;office=hamburg<\\/a><\\/p><\\/li><li><p><a tar