-border-circle\" alt=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" title=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" src=\"/images/hertling/hertling-eberswalde-teasert-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-3-4@m\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <h4 class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-text-left@m uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">Frau A. B. / Europaverkehr</h4> <blockquote class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">„Absoluter professioneller und reibungsloser Umzug. Ausgezeichnetes Team aus der Filiale in Eberswalde. Jederzeit wieder!“</blockquote> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div> </div> </li> <li class=\"el-item uk-width-1-1\"> <div class=\"uk-cover-container\"> <div class=\"uk-panel uk-padding\"><div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"el-meta uk-margin uk-text-meta\">Berlin</div> <div class=\"el-content uk-margin\"><div class=\"uk-grid-margin uk-grid\" uk-grid=\"\"> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-expand@m uk-first-column\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"uk-margin uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\"><img class=\"uk-border-circle\" alt=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" title=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" src=\"/images/hertling/hertling-home-contact-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-3-4@m\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <h4 class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-text-left@m uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">Firmenkunde T. I. D. / Fernverkehr</h4> <blockquote class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">„Nachdem wir uns nun von unserem Umzug in den vergangenen Wochen so einigermaßen erholt haben, wollte ich mich nochmal ganz herzlich bei Ihnen und Ihren Kollegen für die effiziente und freundliche Ausführung bedanken! Zum ersten Mal fand der Umzug bei uns unter der Woche statt, nicht am Wochenende, und die Kollegen waren begeistert, wie reibungslos alles geklappt hat. Bitte geben Sie das Lob an Ihre Mitarbeiter weiter!“</blockquote> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div> </div> </li> <li class=\"el-item uk-width-1-1\"> <div class=\"uk-cover-container\"> <div class=\"uk-panel uk-padding\"><div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"el-meta uk-margin uk-text-meta\">Frankfurt/Main</div> <div class=\"el-content uk-margin\"><div class=\"uk-grid-margin uk-grid\" uk-grid> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-expand@m uk-first-column\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"uk-margin uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class><img class=\"uk-border-circle\" alt=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" title=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" src=\"/images/hertling/hertling-frankfurt-teasert-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-3-4@m\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <h4 class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-text-left@m uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class>Frau M. B. / Import</h4> <blockquote class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class>“The crew was amazing, professional and very knowledgeable in their work performance.“</blockquote> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div> </div> </li> <li class=\"el-item uk-width-1-1\"> <div class=\"uk-cover-container\"> <div class=\"uk-panel uk-padding\"><div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"el-meta uk-margin uk-text-meta\">Düsseldorf</div> <div class=\"el-content uk-margin\"><div class=\"uk-grid-margin uk-grid\" uk-grid> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-