class=\"\">„Es hat alles hervorragend geklappt! Alle Mitarbeiter waren kompetent und sehr freundlich.“</blockquote> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div> </div> </li> <li class=\"el-item uk-width-1-1\"> <div class=\"uk-cover-container\"> <div class=\"uk-panel uk-padding\"><div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"el-meta uk-margin uk-text-meta\">Berlin</div> <div class=\"el-content uk-margin\"><div class=\"uk-grid-margin uk-grid\" uk-grid=\"\"> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-expand@m uk-first-column\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"uk-margin uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\"><img class=\"uk-border-circle\" alt=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" title=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmeinung\" src=\"/images/hertling/hertling-home-contact-01.jpg\" width=\"180\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\"></div> </div> </div> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-3-4@m\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <h4 class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-text-left@m uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">Herr D. W. / Fernverkehr</h4> <blockquote class=\"uk-margin uk-width-xxlarge uk-margin-auto uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class=\"\">„Problemloser, sehr professioneller Umzug. Sehr freundliche Mitarbeiter. Keine Schäden. Gerne wieder!“</blockquote> </div> </div> </div></div></div></div> </div> </li> <li class=\"el-item uk-width-1-1\"> <div class=\"uk-cover-container\"> <div class=\"uk-panel uk-padding\"><div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"el-meta uk-margin uk-text-meta\">Frankfurt/Main</div> <div class=\"el-content uk-margin\"><div class=\"uk-grid-margin uk-grid\" uk-grid> <div class=\"uk-grid-item-match uk-flex-middle uk-width-expand@m uk-first-column\"> <div class=\"uk-panel\"> <div class=\"uk-margin uk-text-center uk-scrollspy-inview uk-animation-fade\" uk-scrollspy-class><img class=\"uk-border-circle\" alt=\"Hertling Umzüge Kundenmei